			<div class="content" id="post-content-711588">
									

<p>Because there is no reason not to do so. The being is not dangerous, and getting out every now and again is good for its mental and emotional health. Remember that generally speaking, the safer an autonomous SCP is, and the more cooperative it is, the better its treatment, and the Foundation can be cruel, but it's not cruel just for sake of cruelty.</p>

